(task-entry (id "fp/combinators/fix-with-tolerance") (skill fp) (module combinators) (tier 1) (difficulty 10666) (name fix-with-tolerance) (type "(-> (-> α α) α α Nat α)") (description "Find fixed point of function (within tolerance)") (notes ()) (section iteration-combinators) (deps (\x27;prelude \x27;sort)) (available (id identity const flip apply-fn compose2 compose pipe2 pipe >>> <<< curry2 uncurry2 curry3 uncurry3 partial partial2 rpartial on both pair-first pair-second bimap complement conjoin disjoin fst snd swap dup pair nothing just just? nothing? from-just maybe maybe-fmap maybe-bind filter-maybe cat-maybes sequence-maybe left right left? right? from-left from-right either either-fmap either-fmap-left either-bind from-either rights lefts partition-eithers head tail cons-if intersperse intercalate group-by dedup-consecutive dedup-consecutive-by iterate-n unfold)) (answer "(define (fix-with-tolerance f x tolerance max-iters) (let loop ((x x) (i 0)) (let ((x-next (f x))) (if (or (>= i max-iters) (< (abs (- x-next x)) tolerance)) x-next (loop x-next (+ i 1))))))"))
