 min=~,1f°  max=~,1f°  avg=~,1f°~n\" (radians->degrees (apply min min-angles)) (radians->degrees (apply max min-angles)) (radians->degrees (/ (apply + min-angles) (length min-angles)))) (printf \"  Max angle: min=~,1f°  max=~,1f°  avg=~,1f°~n\" (radians->degrees (apply min max-angles)) (radians->degrees (apply max max-angles)) (radians->degrees (/ (apply + max-angles) (length max-angles))))))))"))
