ormalize-eigenvector-pair compute-nd-directional-derivatives compute-projected-parameter-derivative classify-codim1-bifurcation-nd bifurcation-diagram-equilibria bifurcation-diagram-amplitude bifurcation-diagram-poincare find-hopf-bifurcation hopf-frequency hopf-criticality first-lyapunov-coefficient hopf-point? compute-hopf-derivatives second-deriv-xx second-deriv-xy second-deriv-yy third-deriv-xxx third-deriv-xxy third-deriv-xyy third-deriv-yyy kuznetsov-l1 detect-period-doubling estimate-period-from-section feigenbaum-delta find-saddle-node-bifurcation matrix-determinant matrix-determinant-lu find-pivot-row-det swap-rows-det! analyze-bifurcations count-stability-changes *branch-switch-perturbation* *branch-switch-tolerance* *branch-switch-max-iter* compute-critical-eigenvector find-min-singular-value-index switch-branch switch-branch-adaptive continue-switched-branch find-all-branches-at-bifurcation lorenz-rho van-der-pol-mu pitchfork-normal-form-param saddle-node-normal-form-param saddle-node-2d-param transcritical-normal-form-param hopf-normal-form-param *diagram-default-max-steps* *diagram-grid-divisions* *diagram-collision-tolerance* make-work-item work-item? work-item-id work-item-param work-item-fp work-item-direction make-bifurcation-diagram bifurcation-diagram? diagram-branches diagram-bifurcations diagram-metadata diagram-branch diagram-bifurcations-of-type make-spatial-hash spatial-hash-cell spatial-hash-register! spatial-hash-lookup register-branch-points! filter-within-bounds make-branch-record branch-record-id branch-record-data branch-record-status branch-record-parent spawn-branches-at-bifurcation trace-bifurcation-diagram stability-is-stable? stability-is-unstable? diagram-stable-points diagram-unstable-points diagram-points-at-param)) (answer "(define (diagram-summary diag) (let* ((branches (diagram-branches diag)) (bifs (diagram-bifurcations diag)) (meta (diagram-metadata diag)) (total-points (apply + (map (lambda (b) (length (cdr b))) branches))) (bif-types (map car bifs)) (type-counts (let loop ((types bif-types) (counts '())) (if (null? types) counts (let* ((t (car types)) (entry (assq t counts))) (loop (cdr types) (if entry (map (lambda (c) (if (eq? (car c) t) (cons t (+ (cdr c) 1)) c)) counts) (cons (cons t 1) counts)))))))) (quasiquote ((branch-count unquote (length branches)) (total-points unquote total-points) (bifurcation-count unquote (length bifs)) (bifurcation-types unquote type-counts) (unquote-splicing meta)))))"))
